# Review a change

Review the changes identified by the user; if no scope is specified, review
the current changes. Do not modify files unless the user separately asks for
fixes. Read `AGENTS.md`, the architecture, conventions and relevant specs.

Inspect behavior, error handling, layer boundaries, transactions, blocking I/O,
tests, observability requirements and unnecessary complexity. Run
`fastapi-harness check` and relevant tests when possible.

Report a prioritized list of actionable findings with file locations, the
violated requirement or risk, impact and suggested correction. Distinguish
verified failures from potential risks. State which checks ran, their results
and any limitations; do not claim compliance for unverified requirements.
If there are no findings, say so and report remaining verification gaps.
